# Icons

When creating or editing any file under `icons/`, **read and apply** the skill before making changes:

1. [.cursor/skills/icons/SKILL.md](../skills/icons/SKILL.md) — mandatory, full workflow and standards
2. [.cursor/skills/icons/reference.md](../skills/icons/reference.md) — path syntax and examples if needed

The skill is the **single source of truth** for icon authoring. Do not rely on deprecated inline rules.

After changes: `npm run build:all` and `npm test`.
